  "usage_note": "**Any** directly before a noun is a determiner: **[[any-det|any]]** *questions* — a separate entry. As a pronoun, **any** is not directly followed by a noun; it stands on its own, or is followed by **of**: *any of the questions*, *I don't have any*.",
